        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1295, 1 Inch Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cylinder style upright floor stop is very easy to install. Packaged with a mounting anchor and rubber bumper ring. The Modern Floor Door Stop is durable, clean looking, and great protection for your door hardware and walls.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BSN-specifications.gif?v=1704354541\" width=\"427\" height=\"204\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions BSN01001 door stop size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOnly 1 hole to drill for fast easy installation. The rubber bumper ring goes all the way around the door stop, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 1295 1 Inch Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 15/16\"<li>\r\nBase to Bumper Center Height: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
